1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,367
But out in the halls, something else
is sick. Nobody gets up. Nobody talks.
The bell stops.

2
00:00:05,867 --> 00:00:10,300
They just lie on the gym mats. Junie
won't read the announcements. She
says, what for?

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,367
What day is it even? It's always the
same day.

4
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:17,567
Give me that radio. Junie. What's the
first thing every morning?

5
00:00:18,067 --> 00:00:18,700
The bell.

6
00:00:20,067 --> 00:00:20,567
Why?

7
00:00:22,067 --> 00:00:25,367
Because a day that starts on time is a
day you can finish.

8
00:00:25,867 --> 00:00:31,633
Rule twelve. Keep the bell ringing.
Lessons, chores, roll call. A schedule
is medicine.

9
00:00:32,133 --> 00:00:38,133
6:40 AM. The bell. One by one, the
masks come back. Fractions. Spelling.
Sam teaches gym, badly.
